<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Bench settings - Timecard Portal</title>
    <%- headTags %>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/nav') %>
    <h1>Bench settings</h1>
    <p class="sub">Rules for how tickets are handed out and checked. Everything here is optional and starts off.</p>
    <% if (flash) { %><div class="msg <%= flash.bad ? 'bad' : 'ok' %>" role="status"><%= flash.msg %></div><% } %>
    <form class="panel" action="/bench/settings" method="POST">
        <label style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start"><input type="checkbox" name="autoassign" value="1" <%= s.autoassign ? 'checked' : '' %> style="width:auto;margin:4px 0 0"><span><strong>Auto-assign new tickets</strong><br><span class="hint">New tickets go to the best-fit student: fewest open tickets, signed off on the needed skills, and clocked in if possible. You can always reassign.</span></span></label>
        <label style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin-top:14px"><input type="checkbox" name="gate3" value="1" <%= s.gate3 ? 'checked' : '' %> style="width:auto;margin:4px 0 0"><span><strong>Tier 3 and 4 repairs need a signed-off student</strong><br><span class="hint">A student can only be given an advanced repair once they are signed off on the skills its parts need (see Skills). Managers can override.</span></span></label>
        <label style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin-top:14px"><input type="checkbox" name="certgate" value="1" <%= s.certgate ? 'checked' : '' %> style="width:auto;margin:4px 0 0"><span><strong>Tickets need a matching repair certification</strong><br><span class="hint">Tier 1 and 2 tickets go only to a Basic Repair Specialist or higher, Tier 3 to a Senior or Master, and Tier 4 to a Master Repair Specialist. Award certifications on the <a href="/certifications">Certifications</a> page. Managers can override.</span></span></label>
        <label style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin-top:14px"><input type="checkbox" name="signoff" value="1" <%= s.signoff ? 'checked' : '' %> style="width:auto;margin:4px 0 0"><span><strong>Mentor check-off before Ready for Pickup</strong><br><span class="hint">A mentor or manager must sign off a repair before it can be marked Repaired - Ready for Pickup. A mentor or manager marking it ready counts as the sign-off.</span></span></label>
        <label for="f" style="margin-top:18px">Call a ticket "long" after this many times the typical repair time</label>
        <input type="number" id="f" name="factor" min="1.2" max="5" step="0.1" value="<%= s.factor %>">
        <p class="hint">Typical time comes from your own finished repairs. A ticket is flagged "Long" once it is open well past it.</p>
        <button type="submit">Save</button>
    </form>
</body>
</html>
